%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management APIs (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant APIGW as Youth Account API Gateway
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TransSvc as Transaction Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant DB as Database

    %% Dashboard API
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & select Youth Account
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth)
    APIGW->>AccountSvc: Get account details
    AccountSvc-->>APIGW: Account details
    APIGW->>TransSvc: Get recent transactions
    TransSvc-->>APIGW: Transactions
    APIGW->>DB: Fetch spending limit
    DB-->>APIGW: Spending limit
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Dashboard data (balance, limit, recent txns)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer API
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGW->>PaymentSvc: Initiate transfer
    PaymentSvc-->>APIGW: Transfer result
    APIGW->>AccountSvc: Update balance
    AccountSvc-->>APIGW: Updated balance
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transfer status
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% Spending Limit API
    Parent->>WebApp: Update spending limit
    WebApp->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGW->>DB: Update limit
    DB-->>APIGW: Update result
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Limit updated
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% Transaction History API
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    APIGW->>TransSvc: Fetch transactions
    TransSvc-->>APIGW: Transactions
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transaction list
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transactions
